      "text": "UART frame (9600, 8N1)\nPC -> MCU: 'a' = 0x61\n[start][8 data bits][stop]\nMCU -> UART0/UART9: ASCII + CRLF",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UART frame (9600, 8N1)\nPC -> MCU: 'a' = 0x61\n[start][8 data bits][stop]\nMCU -> UART0/UART9: ASCII + CRLF",
