      "originalText": "I2C read frame (FC2 master)\nS | 0x1D W | ACK | 0x01 | ACK | Sr | 0x1D R | ACK\nX_MSB | ACK | X_LSB | ACK | Y_MSB | ACK Y_LSB | ACK | Z_MSB | ACK | Z_LSB | NACK | P",
